# ===== PST ERP frontend environment =====

# Local dev: run `npm run dev` (Vite defaults to port 5174 in vite.config.js). The UI uses /api → proxy → backend port 5001.
# so local backend/.env (with AWS) is used. VITE_API_BASE_URL is still required for Vercel production builds.
#
# Only if you need localhost UI to call a remote API:
# VITE_USE_REMOTE_API_WHILE_LOCAL=true
#
# Production (Vercel): set VITE_API_BASE_URL to your API origin (no /api suffix), e.g.:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://pst-api.onrender.com

# Document uploads: POST /api/documents/upload — AWS keys only in pst-erp/backend/.env (or Render env).
